              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "prōmulgō, prōmulgāre — \"to publish, to make known (a bill)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Lēgem novam prōmulgāvit. He published the new law."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "prōmulgō, prōmulgāre, prōmulgāvī, prōmulgātum. A bill was posted for public view before the vote. English promulgate."
            }
          ]
        },
